      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "DP1-DP3: bounded source-bound jobs; immutable outputs, persisted-data checks, then release.\nLarge-source processing ends at Silver; feature engineering/ML use a separate 60-day cohort.\nProduction dedup keeps the window selector; the slower aggregate candidate was not promoted.\nSolid: data files. Dashed: orchestration/metadata. Parquet joins do not enforce SQL foreign keys.\nSources: generator/, pipelines/, airflow/dags/; arrow details link the exact implementation files.",
